{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011Cf6HfiW9rfBgFf7bG8xao","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The new endpoint has been successfully implemented. The build completed without errors.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n1. **src/repositories/ITagRepository.ts** - Added `findPopular()` method to the interface\n2. **src/repositories/TagRepository.ts** - Implemented `findPopular()` using Prisma to query the top 10 tags with article counts, ordered by count descending\n3. **src/services/TagService.ts** - Added `getPopularTags()` method to call the repository\n4. **src/controllers/TagController.ts** - Added `getPopularTags()` handler to process the request and return JSON\n5. **src/routes/tagRoutes.ts** - Registered the new route `GET /tags/popular` (placed before `/tags` to ensure proper routing)\n\nThe endpoint is now available at **GET /api/tags/popular** and returns:\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    { \"name\": \"javascript\", \"count\": 42 },\n    { \"name\": \"react\", \"count\": 38 },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nThe implementation follows the existing architecture pattern (Repository → Service → Controller → Route) and uses Prisma's `_count` and `orderBy` features to efficiently retrieve the top 10 most-used tags."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":36823,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":308},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bced2fb2-eae2-43de-8afc-b404c572f0a6","uuid":"54af8ef9-3e72-480d-960e-916b30533cc3","timestamp":"2026-09-16T01:57:05.369Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6Hfi66mvena6Lfkrs2R"}
